    "detailed_description": "!! FREE DEMO AVAILABLE NOW !!<br><br>After the humans disappeared to the apocalypse, the animals are left to their own devices. One day, Lala the Sheep stumbles upon a Zoo. But the animals are stuck in their cages! Better help get them out, Lala! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/16ea96760cc7fc3f3cee4a5f5237c6e9.webp?t=1637429413\" /></div><br>ZooSim is an adventure exploration game set after the fall of humanity. From eccentric hermits to hard working professionals, this zoo has creatures you would not believe! Befriend them all, and rescue the Zoo from the Apocalypses still lurking past the Silence of the Gods....<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Meet over 50 zoo animals, and free them from their cages!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/9a610a795504f2ac12ceacb7aeb9ebf5.webp?t=1637429413\" /></div><br></li><li> Character-driven story! For instance, reunite a computer with their beloved mother in literature's most tearjerking scene! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/ce9c7fc904c72e29c9197bddfae257de.avif?t=1637429413\" /></div><br></li><li> Jokes! Funnies! Little blessings from the heavens that make you laugh! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/1cb754653bcbc5aaccdbd4b4e0a8fc7b.webp?t=1637429413\" /></div><br></li><li> Get your teeth cleaned by a friendly dentist!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/3026069cf2702c56b30158cbb23e67e3.avif?t=1637429413\" /></div><br></li><li> 60,000 yummy gummy words! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/25470ec46aa696ceae77b57fb4eb47fd.avif?t=1637429413\" /></div><br></li><li> Play mini-games along the way!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/9a610a795504f2ac12ceacb7aeb9ebf5.webp?t=1637429413\" /></div><br></li><li> Eight cool endings! Choose the mayor best suited to lead the zoo!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482790/extras/0ec0c1111a4a90748fef03b99cb327b1.avif?t=1637429413\" /></div></li></ul>",
